NC Digital is based in Merthyr Tydfil, which means if you're a local business looking to sell online, you're working with a team that's right on your doorstep. We build custom ecommerce websites for Merthyr Tydfil businesses — fully designed around your brand, not built from a template.

Ecommerce sites start from **£800**, with the price depending on your platform choice, number of products, and any specific functionality you need.

## Ecommerce platforms we build in Merthyr Tydfil

We work across three main platforms depending on what's right for your business:

**Shopify** — ideal for product-based businesses wanting a fast, reliable store with minimal maintenance overhead. Every Shopify site we build is custom-designed from scratch.

**WooCommerce** — built on WordPress, giving you full flexibility and control. A great option if you're already on WordPress or need bespoke functionality. Custom-designed to match your brand.

**SureCart** — a modern platform suited to digital products, subscriptions, and service businesses taking payments online. Also fully custom-designed.

## Why sell online?

For Merthyr Tydfil businesses, having an online store means you're not limited to footfall. You can reach customers across the Valleys, across South Wales, and across the UK — 24 hours a day. A well-built ecommerce site pays for itself.

## What we build for Merthyr Tydfil businesses

- Custom online store designed for your products and brand
- Mobile-first design — most shoppers browse on their phones
- Secure checkout with payment gateway integration
- Product management system — add and update products yourself after launch
- On-page SEO so your products show up in Google
- Google Analytics and conversion tracking from day one

